: "neutral", "regime_label": "MIXED", "regime_why": "weekly momentum just crossed up; investor cycle failed (broke its start low); last cycle left-translated (topped early)", "regime_score": -0.5, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: MIXED \u2014 weekly momentum just crossed up; investor cycle failed (broke its start low); last cycle left-translated (topped early) (investor cycle week 12 \u00b7 failed \u00b7 daily cycle broke its start low 28d ago).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): unconfirmed turn. Bigger picture (no clear trend): mixed.", "points": ["Bigger picture is mixed (no clear trend for a daily long)", "\u26a0 Failed cycle \u2014 price broke below the low that began this cycle (28d ago)", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Back above the 10-day average, and it's turning up", "Prior cycle topped early (a tiring-trend hint)"], "entry": {"tag": "UNCONFIRMED \u2014 HIGH RISK", "tag_zh": "\u672a\u786e\u8ba4 \u2014 \u9ad8\u98ce\u9669", "urgency": "caution", "text": "An unconfirmed turn: a daily low is forming while the bigger picture is still bearish. Nimble traders only \u2014 small size, defined stop below 240.2. Not an investment buy until the weekly confirms; most of these fail, a minority start a new cycle.", "text_zh": "\u672a\u786e\u8ba4\u8f6c\u5411\uff1a\u65e5\u7ebf\u4f4e\u70b9\u6b63\u5728\u5f62\u6210\uff0c\u4f46\u5927\u5c40\u4ecd\u504f\u7a7a\u3002\u4ec5\u9650\u7075\u6d3b\u4ea4\u6613\u8005\u2014\u2014\u5c0f\u4ed3\u4f4d\u3001\u6b62\u635f\u8bbe\u4e8e 240.2 \u4e0b\u65b9\u3002\u5728\u5468\u7ebf\u786e\u8ba4\u524d\u5e76\u975e\u6295\u8d44\u6027\u4e70\u5165\uff1b\u591a\u6570\u6700\u7ec8\u5931\u8d25\uff0c\u5c11\u6570\u5219\u5f00\u542f\u65b0\u5468\u671f\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 56 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "overdue \u2014 past the typical window, so a low could form any day", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 56 \u5929\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 36\u201342 \u4e2a